sequenceDiagram
    participant PlatformOp as opendatahub-operator
    participant ConfigMap as ConfigMap<br/>odh-aigateway-config
    participant AIGWCR as AIGateway CR<br/>(cluster-scoped)
    participant Operator as ai-gateway-operator<br/>8081/TCP Health<br/>8443/TCP Metrics
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant MaaS as maas-controller<br/>(vendored)
    participant BatchGW as batch-gateway-operator<br/>(vendored)
    participant AIGWCtrl as ai-gateway-controller<br/>(vendored)

    Note over PlatformOp,AIGWCtrl: Flow 1: Sub-Component Deployment

    PlatformOp->>AIGWCR: Create/Update AIGateway CR<br/>ServiceAccount Auth
    AIGWCR-->>Operator: Watch triggers reconcile
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Read ManagementState fields<br/>TLS 1.2+ / ServiceAccount
    Operator->>Operator: Kustomize render<br/>(in-memory, RELATED_IMAGE substitution)

    alt modelsAsAService.managementState = Managed
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Apply MaaS manifests<br/>TLS 1.2+ / ServiceAccount
        K8sAPI-->>MaaS: Deploy maas-controller
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Apply ai-gateway-controller manifests<br/>TLS 1.2+ / ServiceAccount
        K8sAPI-->>AIGWCtrl: Deploy ai-gateway-controller
    end

    alt batchGateway.managementState = Managed
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Apply batch-gateway manifests<br/>TLS 1.2+ / ServiceAccount
        K8sAPI-->>BatchGW: Deploy batch-gateway-operator
    end

    Note over PlatformOp,AIGWCtrl: Flow 2: MaaS Teardown Handshake

    PlatformOp->>AIGWCR: Set modelsAsAService.managementState = Removed
    AIGWCR-->>Operator: Watch triggers reconcile
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Annotate maas-controller Deployment<br/>teardown-requested=true
    K8sAPI-->>MaaS: Annotation propagated
    MaaS->>K8sAPI: Delete Config/default<br/>Clean runtime resources
    MaaS->>K8sAPI: Annotate self<br/>teardown-completed=true
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: Watch detects teardown-completed
    Operator->>K8sAPI: GC action: delete MaaS +<br/>ai-gateway-controller resources

    Note over PlatformOp,AIGWCtrl: Flow 3: Platform Upgrade Handshake

    PlatformOp->>ConfigMap: Write platformVersion
    ConfigMap-->>Operator: Read platformVersion
    Operator->>AIGWCR: Write status.releases<br/>(echo platform version)
    AIGWCR-->>PlatformOp: Verify version alignment
